1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Björnen blundar …

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,000
tänk om, tänk om …

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,200
En rutschkana!

4
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,500
(En rutschkana!)

5
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:06,500
Ner i kolasås!

6
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,400
(Kolasås!)

7
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,000
Nu kör vi dit –

8
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,300
brum, brum!

9
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,000
Brun, brun! (Brun, brun!)

10
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,300
Rutscha ner i kolasås –

11
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:13,900
(wiii!)

12
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:17,200
Plask, plask, plask! (Plask, plask, plask!)

13
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,200
Upp igen – en gång till!

14
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,500
(En, två, tre!)

15
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,900
Rutscha ner i kolasås –

16
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,600
(wiii!)

17
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,300
Kola på nosen!

18
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,500
(Mums, mums!)

19
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Brun är den godaste färgen!

20
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:27,900
(Mmm!)

21
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,000
Vad är brunt?

22
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:29,900
Titta ut!

